# INVWINV.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: DEL in the item
# list at level 2 (CLERK).  DEL asks first; N keeps the item; Y deletes
# it and the list is fetched again.  Deleting the last row of the list
# selects the row before; with the list empty DEL does nothing.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINV.SNP is its snapshot.
T CLERK
K TAB
T Clerk1986
K ENTER
S LIST
K DOWN DEL
S ASK
K N
S KEPT
K DEL
S ASK2
K Y
S DELETED
# item 3 is the last row: delete it, the first row stays
K DEL
S ASK3
K Y
S LAST
# the only item, then nothing to delete
K DEL
S ASK4
K Y
S EMPTY
K DEL
S NOTHING
